# # /fastmdxplora/
#
# Persistent identifiers for FastMDXplora: the profile a shared study keeps
# (https://w3id.org/fastmdxplora/study/<MAJOR.MINOR>) and the terms its
# packing list uses (https://w3id.org/fastmdxplora/terms#<term>). Both
# redirect to the documentation; the root redirects to the repository.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Adekunle Aina
# kunleaina@gmail.com
# GitHub username: ainaadekunle

RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^study(/[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)?/?$ https://fastmdxplora.readthedocs.io/en/latest/sharing.html [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^terms/?$ https://fastmdxplora.readthedocs.io/en/latest/sharing.html [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/aai-research-lab/FastMDXplora [R=302,L]
